@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

title statlord — System Architecture (de1ux/statlord @ 2677633)

actor "Browser Editor User" as EditorUser
actor "API Client" as ApiClient

package "Client (Browser)" {
  component "Editor SPA\nTypeScript / React" as Editor
  component "Redux Store\n(controls, elements, layouts,\ngauges, displays)" as Redux
  component "Canvas Operations\n(render / delete)" as Canvas
  component "Viewer Rendering Path\n(black & white pixel view\nat display resolution)" as Viewer
}

package "Server (Python 3.7 / Django)" {
  component "HTTP API Layer\n(Web / JSON)" as API
  component "Static Asset Host\n(built client assets)" as Static

  package "Domain Models" {
    component "Gauge\n{key, value}" as Gauge
    component "Display\n{key, available, resolution_x, resolution_y,\ncurrent_layout, display_data, rotation}" as Display
    component "Layout\n{key, data, display_positions}" as Layout
  }
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB

EditorUser --> Editor : uses in browser
ApiClient --> API : posts data / registers displays

Editor --> Redux
Editor --> Canvas
Editor --> Viewer
Redux ..> Canvas : state-driven edits

Canvas --> API : layout render / delete requests
Editor --> API : layout creation & editing
Viewer --> API : reads display data / layout
Static --> Editor : serves static assets

API --> Gauge : FR-001 / DR-001
API --> Display : FR-002, FR-003 / DR-002
API --> Layout : FR-006 / DR-004

Gauge --> DB : persist
Display --> DB : persist
Layout --> DB : persist

Display --> Layout : current_layout\n(nullable; set to null on layout delete, DR-009)

note right of Viewer
  FR-007: generates per-display
  rendered output; full
  headless-browser rendering
  requires separate verification.
end note

note bottom of API
  NFR-004 / C-006: containerized deployment is
  development-grade — Django dev server
  (./manage.py runserver), not production-ready.
  Client must be built first (npm install && npm run build, C-003).
end note

@enduml
